  "description": "QATYOC crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n a 21. Reported CIF formula moiety: C55 H52 Dy4 N10 O18 S4. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 4 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.600-3.714 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.17-112.88°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ4-O)(HL)3(SCN)4(H2O)2]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
